legal.terms.s4.content:
The Platform offers the following services:

### For all Users (free access)
- Creating and customising a public profile;
- Optional identity verification (KYC);
- Viewing public profiles, Reviews and rental histories;
- Participating in Rental Relationships.

### For Landlords (Subscription required after free period)
- Adding, managing and tracking properties;
- Creating and managing Rental Relationships and applications;
- Access to centralised documents (lease, inventories, shared documents);
- Submitting Reviews on Tenants;
- Dashboard, analytics and advanced notifications.

### For Tenants (entirely free access)
- Viewing Landlord profiles and properties;
- Participating in Rental Relationships initiated by a Landlord;
- Submitting Reviews on Landlords and properties;
- Access to shared documents within a Rental Relationship.

### Property Boost (optional paid service)
Service allowing a property to be featured in Platform results for one calendar month.

The Platform is currently in pre-launch. DSquare Development SRL reserves the right to change the features offered at any time.

